  {
   "section": "explore",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Explore Storage Solutions"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "NAS Storage Solutions"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "NAS (network attached storage) is a device that connects to your network so multiple users can share, back up, and access files from any connected device. Ideal for small teams, families, and creative workflows that need centralized shared storage."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Learn More",
     "href": "/solutions/network-attached-storage"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Gaming Storage"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Gaming storage is purpose-built for fast load times, large game libraries, and save state reliability across PC, console, and handheld setups. Western Digital offers HDDs and SSDs configured for desktop, laptop, PS5, and Xbox gaming."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Learn More",
     "href": "/solutions/gaming"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "RAID Storage Solutions"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "RAID (Redundant Array of Independent Disks) combines multiple drives into one logical system to improve speed, add redundancy, or both. Common configurations include RAID 0 (speed), RAID 1 (redundancy), RAID 5 (balanced), and RAID 10 (speed plus redundancy)."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Learn More",
     "href": "/solutions/raid"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Video Surveillance Storage"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Surveillance storage is designed for 24/7 continuous recording with high write endurance and stable performance under constant load. WD Purple drives are engineered specifically for DVR and NVR security systems."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "Learn More",
     "href": "/solutions/surveillance"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "Backup & Recovery Solutions"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Backup and recovery storage protects your files from data loss with automatic scheduled backups, encryption, and simple restore. Available as external and internal drives with built-in backup software for personal and small business use."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "Learn More",
     "href": "/solutions/home-backup-solutions"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "Enterprise & Data Center Storage"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "Enterprise storage delivers high-capacity, high-reliability hard drives built for data center workloads — including AI training, cloud infrastructure, and high-performance computing. WD Ultrastar drives are engineered for density, endurance, and low total cost of ownership."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Learn More",
     "href": "/solutions/data-center"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "Content Creation Storage"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "Content creation storage handles large media files — 4K and 8K video, RAW photography, multi-track audio — with the speed and capacity needed for professional workflows. Built for editors, photographers, producers, and filmmakers."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Learn More",
     "href": "/solutions/creative-professionals"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 22,
     "text": "Platform Storage Solutions for Data Centers"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 23,
     "text": "Platform storage combines HDDs, SSDs, and disaggregated architecture into rack-scale systems optimized for AI training, HPC, and hyperscale cloud. Engineered for low TCO and NVMe-over-Fabrics performance."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 24,
     "text": "Learn More",
     "href": "/solutions/data-center-storage-platform"
    }
   ],
