    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 29,
     "text": "What is the best storage solution for my needs?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 30,
     "text": "The best storage depends on your use case: for , for shared team access, for performance and redundancy, for 24/7 video recording, and for large-scale data center workloads. WD builds purpose-engineered hard drives for each of these scenarios."
    },
    {
