    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 37,
     "text": "What is the best storage for businesses?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 38,
     "text": "Most businesses combine three solutions: for shared file access and collaboration, for performance-critical systems, and for offsite backup. Larger businesses add for data center workloads, AI training, and cloud infrastructure. WD offers dedicated HDD lines for each tier — , for enterprise."
    },
